Z||000000||sqoach||04-18-2001||05:42 PM||||As I was pulling out of the driveway the other night, my mom told me my back-up lights were not on. They worked before. I don't really think both lightbulbs burned out, but I haven't checked. Already checked the fuse, and it's good. Now, where is that stupid back-up light switch? It's really easy to find on my 84 SE 4 spd. I guess the 5 spd is different?<P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach2.JPG">   <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||5
