Z||000009||c m west||04-19-2001||04:58 PM||||You will find that when the shifter is first placed to the left before moving the shifter forward that the reverse lights will come on - once the shifter is engaged forward into the reverse detent location - the reverse lights will go out - your problem is that your switch simply needs to be adjusted - PERIOD.<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
